    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Denial.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Anger.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bargaining.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Depression.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a lone path of vengeance, as you step closer to your ultimate choice. In which way will you come to <i>acceptance? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game features:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story about grief, suffering, and faith</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 levels of increasing difficulty</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 different guns to adapt to</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 extraordinary enemy types</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frantic fighting around every corner</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ample RNG for unpredictability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A substantial soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A secret level...</strong></p></li></ul>",
